  "_elementor_data": "[{\"id\":\"422670b1\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"7c0657cf\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<h1>Puzzle Path's Upcoming Adventures<\\/h1><p>[puzzlepath_upcoming_adventures sort=\\\"featured\\\" show_sort_dropdown=\\\"true\\\"]<\\/p><h1>Live &amp; Anytime Hunts Across <br \\/>Queensland<\\/h1><h3>\\ud83e\\udded Choose Your<br \\/>Next<br \\/>Puzzle Path <br \\/>Adventure<\\/h3><p>Whether you\\u2019re looking for a <strong data-start=\\\"231\\\" data-end=\\\"258\\\">hosted group experience (Live Adventures)<\\/strong>\\u00a0or a <strong data-start=\\\"264\\\" data-end=\\\"304\\\">flexible quest you can start anytime (Anytime Adventures)<\\/strong>, Puzzle Path has an adventure for you! Select the style that suits your journey and uncover Queensland one clue at a time.<\\/p><h2 style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">Live vs Anytime \\u2013 Which One's Right for You?<\\/h2><p>At Puzzle Path, we offer two exciting ways to experience our immersive scavenger hunts across Queensland, both are packed with puzzles, challenges, and iconic local landmarks \\u2014 but each offers a different style of play to suit your schedule and personality.<\\/p><p>Experience Puzzle Path like never before with a Live Adventure \\u2014 a hosted, guided scavenger hunt led by one of our expert Puzzle Masters.<\\/p><p>Join fellow adventurers as you explore Queensland in real-time, solving cryptic clues, completing interactive challenges, and sharing laughs along the way. Perfect for group events, date days, birthdays, and corporate team building.<\\/p><p><img role=\\\"img\\\" draggable=\\\"false\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/s.w.org\\/images\\/core\\/emoji\\/16.0.1\\/svg\\/1f4cd.svg\\\" alt=\\\"\\ud83d\\udccd\\\" \\/> Available at scheduled times and locations<br \\/><img role=\\\"img\\\" draggable=\\\"false\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/s.w.org\\/images\\/core\\/emoji\\/16.0.1\\/svg\\/2705.svg\\\" alt=\\\"\\u2705\\\" \\/> Guided by a live host<br \\/><img role=\\\"img\\\" draggable=\\\"false\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/s.w.org\\/images\\/core\\/emoji\\/16.0.1\\/svg\\/2705.svg\\\" alt=\\\"\\u2705\\\" \\/> Ideal for social and group experiences<\\/p><p>Book a Live Adventure and uncover Queensland one clue at a time!<\\/p><p>\\u00a0<\\/p><p>\\u00a0<\\/p><p>Take the scenic route\\u2014on foot! These self-paced adventures guide you through parks, beaches, and laneways as you solve riddles, uncover local trivia, and explore places you never knew existed.<br data-start=\\\"479\\\" data-end=\\\"482\\\" \\/><strong data-start=\\\"482\\\" data-end=\\\"497\\\">Perfect for<\\/strong> families, couples, tourists, and locals who love to wander and wonder.<\\/p><h2>\\ud83e\\uddd1\\u200d\\ud83e\\udd1d\\u200d\\ud83e\\uddd1 Team &amp; Group Quests<\\/h2><p>Compete or collaborate in real-time with timed puzzles, scoreboards, and challenges. These quests are built for group energy\\u2014perfect for events that want to blend teamwork with adventure.<br \\/>Perfect for corporate events, hens\\/bucks nights, birthday parties, or school excursions.<\\/p><h2>\\ud83d\\udc68\\u200d\\ud83d\\udc69\\u200d\\ud83d\\udc67\\u200d\\ud83d\\udc66 Family &amp; Kid Friendly Quests<\\/h2><p>Imaginative, visual, and built for little adventurers! These shorter, story-driven trails include easy clues, colourful maps, and interactive surprises to keep younger players engaged.<br \\/>Perfect for families with kids aged 5\\u201312, school groups, or parent-child bonding.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false}]",
